    “Marysia!” burst from him.
    “Papa!” they all answered, stretching out their arms to him, and all of them rose at once, like one child in a dozen bodies. Before he could think, one reached him first and flung her arms round his neck. She breathed softly into his ear. He pressed her to him.{ przed_panem_lasu == zawolal_marysie: Only then did he remember what the Lord of the Forest had said: at dawn, do not listen with your ears.} # dalej
