    ~ znak_rozpoznania = po_drewniaku
    {drugi_drewniak:Jaromir took both red clogs from inside his shirt and laid them on the lichen.|Jaromir took the red clog from inside his shirt and laid it on the lichen.} Every morning, after all, she would grope under her pillow for her clogs. # pokaz: drewniak
    All the little hands reached out at once. The girls flew at the red like sparrows at crumbs, jostling and shoving one another. The quickest seized a clog and hugged it to her, and Jaromir snatched her up into his arms without thinking.
    The Lord of the Forest laughed softly, drily, like the snap of a twig. “Children like red things,” he said. “All of them.” # dalej
