    All the thongs were alike, and on each one hung the same thing: {skarb_jaromira == muszelka:a piece of shell|{skarb_jaromira == pioro:a jay’s feather|a nail}}. But Jaromir knew his treasure better than the back of his own hand—from the age of eight he had taken it on every expedition out of the den, and after that, for three years, he had watched Marysia turn it over and over in her little fist. He bent over each neck, touching none.
